t;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I do airbrush makeup&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;regular makeup with mac cosmetics,Chanel,makeup forever and Anastasia&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;i do highlights and contour&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;eyelashes extension&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;full lashes&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;hairdo and blow dry&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;love to work on destination wedding&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;for more info visit my website www.judymakeup.tk&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;instagram judysbeautybar&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Facebook Judy n figueroa&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cel: 1 849 353 9986 \/ 1 631 994 5476&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;email judyfdetavares@hotmail.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Judy N Figueroa&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Professional Makeup Artist&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Senior in colors&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Brazilian Blow dry specialist&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887433,"PostDate":1424835810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello gorgeous<\/p>\n<p>Congratulation.....<\/p>\n<p>I'm a Professional Makeup Artist from new York now living in Dominican Republic<\/p>\n<p>I do airbrush makeup<\/p>\n<p>regular makeup with mac cosmetics,Chanel,makeup forever and Anastasia<\/p>\n<p>i do highlights and contour<\/p>\n<p>eyelashes extension<\/p>\n<p>full lashes<\/p>\n<p>hairdo and blow dry<\/p>\n<p>love to work on destination wedding<\/p>\n<p>for more info visit my website www.judymakeup.tk<\/p>\n<p>instagram judysbeautybar<\/p>\n<p>Facebook Judy n figueroa<\/p>\n<p>Cel: 1 849 353 9986 \/ 1 631 994 5476<\/p>\n<p>email judyfdetavares@hotmail.com<\/p>\n<p>Judy N Figueroa<\/p>\n<p>Professional Makeup Artist\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Senior in colors<\/p>\n<p>Brazilian Blow dry specialist<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"judys_beauty_bar@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.69.68.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1363712024,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267545.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":113,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JudyBeautyBaR","Id":267545,"Name":"JudyBeautyBaR","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":32,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
