":false,"PostKey":"8b52dea1ba6024f11c0fa57a0fc64060","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;Hi everybody.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Now I received a marriage proposal from my boyfriend, I was very pleased and happy. My boyfriend wants us to marry the following year (2016). Now work is also quite busy, so I can not be a stable arrangement.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I want a dramatic wedding, people can give me ideas instead.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;thank you much!&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905386,"PostDate":1443173295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>Hi everybody.<\/div>\n<div>Now I received a marriage proposal from my boyfriend, I was very pleased and happy. My boyfriend wants us to marry the following year (2016). Now work is also quite busy, so I can not be a stable arrangement.<\/div>\n<div>I want a dramatic wedding, people can give me ideas instead.<\/div>\n<div>thank you much!<\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vbet79.net\/link-vao-bet365\/'><strong>bet365<\/strong><\/a>","Email":"jijung2003@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.59.8.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443172636,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284926.jpg?_r=1443606216","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DungMai","Id":284926,"Name":"DungMai","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"116.100.185.53","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79618,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13d74950c89c7138c2f61f9a07e79e6d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"DungMai\" post=\"1905386\" timestamp=\"1443173295\"]\n\nHi everybody.\nNow I received a marriage proposal from my boyfriend, I was very pleased and happy. My boyfriend wants us to marry the following year (2016). Now work is also quite busy, so I can not be a stable arrangement.\nI want a dramatic wedding, people can give me ideas instead.\nthank you much!\n\n\nare you sure with your idea ???[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1905387,"PostDate":1443173864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>DungMai, on 25 September 2015 - 01:28 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>Hi everybody.<\/div>\n<div>Now I received a marriage proposal from my boyfriend, I was very pleased and happy. My boyfriend wants us to marry the following year (2016). Now work is also quite busy, so I can not be a stable arrangement.<\/div>\n<div>I want a dramatic wedding, people can give me ideas instead.<\/div>\n<div>thank you much!<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>are you sure with your idea ???<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a href='<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/w88int.com\/%27'>http:\/\/w88int.com\/'><\/a>w88 <\/a>\u00a0 ","Email":"trantamnq1689@gmail.com","IpAddress":"116.100.185.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443173629,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tommytrant20","Id":284927,"Name":"tommytrant20","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79618,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"171336297376299b65d31127aaf3b3cb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"DungMai\" post=\"1905386\" timestamp=\"1443173295\"]\n\nHi everybody.\nNow I received a marriage proposal from my boyfriend, I was very pleased and happy. My boyfriend wants us to marry the following year (2016). Now work is also quite busy, so I can not be a stable arrangement.\nI want a dramatic wedding, people can give me ideas instead.\nthank you much!\n[\/quote]@[member=\"DungMai\"][b] [\/b]have you consider hiring a professional wedding planner to assist you with your vision.  I had prepared this article for newbies to help you started with your planning.\n\nww.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/kick-overwhelmed-in-the-butt-and-enjoy-planning-r2291\n\n\nHappy Planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1905451,"PostDate":1443221145,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p 