Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79407,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"067234a2e6dda4e9b647248257d2d9dc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"BB2015\" post=\"1901522\" timestamp=\"1438204313\"]\n@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]...thank you for all your info on this app! It really helps...I have 2 questions for you. 1. Do you know if you can edit music with it? For example, I want our recessional song to start about halfway through the song...should I pre-edit it? If so, any suggestions on an app that would do that? :) 2. What type of speakers will you be using. The cost to rent a PA system for our wedding is crazy expensive so we were thinking of bringing our own...\nThanks!!! Brooke[\/quote]You&#039;re welcome. I still have to iron out the last few things on our playlists before leaving for our wedding. This is my #1 stress right now haha. \n\nAs far as I know you can&#039;t edit the songs in there. The best the app does is if you want to cut a song off it just fades it out into the next song or to silence, but if you want to start a song half way through you&#039;d have to edit it before putting it on your playlist. I&#039;m not sure what kind of app you&#039;d need to do that. \n\nWe are renting an amplifier with an ipod hook up from the resort. They&#039;re charging us $250 for 4 hours which I thought was decent (compared to $1500 for a DJ). Where are you planning your wedding? If it&#039;s in the Riviera Maya you can contact @KatyHK. I know she has an amplifier that she can rent out and her prices are very reasonable. She also has a facebook page called Love &amp;amp; Lace Wedding Decor. I&#039;m renting a few things from her. I&#039;m afraid that the at home bluetooth speakers won&#039;t be enough, I think you definitely need an amplifier.","Attachments":[],"Id":1901599,"PostDate":1438255278,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>BB2015, on 29 July 2015 - 04:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a>...thank you for all your info on this app! It really helps...I have 2 questions for you. 1. Do you know if you can edit music with it? For example, I want our recessional song to start about halfway through the song...should I pre-edit it? If so, any suggestions on an app that would do that? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> 2. What type of speakers will you be using. The cost to rent a PA system for our wedding is crazy expensive so we were thinking of bringing our own...<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!! Brooke<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>You're welcome. I still have to iron out the last few things on our playlists before leaving for our wedding. This is my #1 stress right now haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As far as I know you can't edit the songs in there. The best the app does is if you want to cut a song off it just fades it out into the next song or to silence, but if you want to start a song half way through you'd have to edit it before putting it on your playlist. I'm not sure what kind of app you'd need to do that.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are renting an amplifier with an ipod hook up from the resort. They're charging us $250 for 4 hours which I thought was decent (compared to $1500 for a DJ). Where are you planning your wedding? If it's in the Riviera Maya you can contact @KatyHK. I know she has an amplifier that she can rent out and her prices are very reasonable. She also has a facebook page called Love & Lace Wedding Decor. I'm renting a few things from her. I'm afraid that the at home bluetooth speakers won't be enough, I think you definitely need an amplifier.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359745104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.217.8.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79407,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"da04f6d5d12722c27ff9eed019f86bdb","RawContent":"@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]..thanks for your response! We are actually getting married in Cabo. turns out the PA system is $370...don&#039;t know why I thought it was $570. Still a bit steep but we are just going to go with it. Don&#039;t want to take a risk that people won&#039;t hear the music! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1901628,"PostDate":1438298876,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a>..thanks for your response! We are actually getting married in Cabo. turns out the PA system is $370...don't know why I thought it was $570. Still a bit steep but we are just going to go with it. Don't want to take a risk that people won't hear the music! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"weddingbb2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.217.9.121","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420319446,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281588.jpg?_r=1439315189","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"BB2015","Id":281588,"Name":"BB2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.54.102.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79407,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56038a8f747fbc3e9b2834198f9e6275","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;KEEP LOOKING SOMEONE IS IN NEED OF WORK THAT NIGHT.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901973,"PostDate":1438825045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>KEEP LOOKING SOMEONE IS IN NEED OF WORK THAT NIGHT.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dathotgal51@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.77.182.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423454325,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282047.jpg?_r=1440421860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"dathotgal","Id":282047,"Name":"dathotgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.161.84.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79407,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"927a3c556043c34193444bcb552e48db","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for sharing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904509,"PostDate":1441953735,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for sharing.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"johnshepard2015@outlook.com","IpAddress":"45.61.34.188","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1435907214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"michaelgoodall","Id":283797,"Name":"michaelgoodall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79407,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8352ecbf655ed901dc298d066b344ec4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve also heard superb things approximately the marriage DJ app. I don&#039;t have an iPhone myself, but I do have an iPad, so I think we&#039;re going to load that up with all of the tune and try it out! We are not hiring a DJ so this is quite much our simplest alternative at this point.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904899,"PostDate":1442450984,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've also heard superb things approximately the marriage DJ app. I don't have an iPhone myself, but I do have an iPad, so I think we're going to load that up with all of the tune and try it out! We are not hiring a DJ so this is quite much our simplest alternative at this point.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rahulthakur01@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438818968,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rahulthakur01","Id":284300,"Name":"rahulthakur01","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":15,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
