a Sans&#039;, sans-serif;font-size:14.004px;\"&gt;I would like to know of any recommendations people may have for a good videography\/photography team?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904860,"PostDate":1442402160,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(74,74,74);font-family:Arial, Tahoma,'Bitstream Vera Sans', sans-serif;font-size:14.004px;\">I would like to know of any recommendations people may have for a good videography\/photography team?<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laszloemi@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"188.143.72.19","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442401949,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284839.jpg?_r=1443621732","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"sarah0025","Id":284839,"Name":"sarah0025","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"188.143.72.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79594,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Katharina00, 16 September 2015 - 11:38 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1442403533,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f70d998b0783c905cdbe54c543ab703","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I just booked the Weddingroll team &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/weddingroll.eu&#039;&gt;http:\/\/weddingroll.eu&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;&#039;&gt;f&lt;\/a&gt;or&amp;nbsp;my wedding...after reading about them in people&#039;s wedding reviews, and looking at their portfolio I completely fell in love. Their prices are really amazing, too! I&#039;ve been emailing with them the past few days, and they are always very friendly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904863,"PostDate":1442403267,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>I just booked the Weddingroll team <a href='http:\/\/weddingroll.eu' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/weddingroll.eu<\/a>\u00a0<a href='' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>f<\/a>or\u00a0my wedding...after reading about them in people's wedding reviews, and looking at their portfolio I completely fell in love. Their prices are really amazing, too! I've been emailing with them the past few days, and they are always very friendly.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katharinak001@euromail.hu","IpAddress":"92.249.156.253","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441509563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284693.jpg?_r=1443621732","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Katharina00","Id":284693,"Name":"Katharina00","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.12.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79594,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f0d7dd3088d29aaf2c35e82dae7d704","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"sarah0025\"] Congrats and welcome. You don&#039;t say what country you&#039;re looking to find a photographer. I&#039;ll guess since you&#039;re on this site that it&#039;s for a wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The best thing would be to go to the top of the page and click on Vendor Reviews then click on Photographer Reviews. There are a lot but you can narrow it down by country. The second thing would be to take a list from the Vendor Reviews and go to each of the respective websites and look at what they have. Everyone is different in what they like and don&#039;t like. Some photos might speak to you, others might not. Then contact the ones you&#039;re interested in for pricing and see if they&#039;re even available for whatever date you have in mind.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904888,"PostDate":1442434015,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284839\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284839-sarah0025\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sarah0025<\/span><\/a> Congrats and welcome. You don't say what country you're looking to find a photographer. I'll guess since you're on this site that it's for a wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The best thing would be to go to the top of the page and click on Vendor Reviews then click on Photographer Reviews. There are a lot but you can narrow it down by country. The second thing would be to take a list from the Vendor Reviews and go to each of the respective websites and look at what they have. Everyone is different in what they like and don't like. Some photos might speak to you, others might not. Then contact the ones you're interested in for pricing and see if they're even available for whatever date you have in mind.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.51.43.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79594,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fbac1808ab568e2ec2be4d8c39f45540","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Definitely check out the vendor reviews section here in the forum! Also, things to consider when you&#039;re looking for a photographer\/videographer:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-- Figure out what style of photography\/videography you are drawn to&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-- Set aside a budget range that you&#039;re willing to invest in photos\/videos (you may need to adjust this accordingly as you start to look into teams you are drawn to)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;-- Decide whether you want to hire someone local to your destination area OR do you want to hire a team that may be local to where you live and fly them out? (I did this and it worked out great!)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also make sure to contact your resort\/wedding venue and check and see if you&#039;re allowed to bring in outside vendors. Some places will either require that you use their specific set of recommended vendors or they&#039;ll require that you pay an outside vendor fee -- definitely something to consider when you figure out your budget!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps :) (I should write a blog post about this!!! LOL)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1904956,"PostDate":1442503227,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Definitely check out the vendor reviews section here in the forum! Also, things to consider when you're looking for a photographer\/videographer:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>-- Figure out what style of photography\/videography you are drawn to<\/p>\n<p>-- Set aside a budget range that you're willing to invest in photos\/videos (you may need to adjust this accordingly as you start to look into teams you are drawn to)<\/p>\n<p>-- Decide whether you want to hire someone local to your destination area OR do you want to hire a team that may be local to where you live and fly them out? (I did this and it worked out great!)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also make sure to contact your resort\/wedding venue and check and see if you're allowed to bring in outside vendors. Some places will either require that you use their specific set of recommended vendors or they'll require that you pay an outside vendor fee -- definitely something to consider when you figure out your budget!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> (I should write a blog post about this!!! LOL)\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285936345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79594","Title":"Recommendations For Wedding Photography & Videography?","LastPostDate":1442503227},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
