Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":490,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1903703,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284502,"Name":"SuBe","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1440784271,"LastPoster":{"Id":228415,"Name":"JwdEvents","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228415.jpg?_r=1443483879","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1903703,"PostDate":1440784271,"PostContent":"Hi! \u00a0 My Fiance and I have started to plan our wedding for April 2017 and are highly considering...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sugeily22@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.211.224.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440083284,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SuBe","Id":284502,"Name":"SuBe","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.211.224.254","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6531c540b4494e8b4c193e61a58d02d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My Fiance and I have started to plan our wedding for April 2017 and are highly considering Akiin Beach Tulum. Would love to hear from other brides who had their wedding at this Venue or from those who are planning to host their wedding at Akiin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any other tips and suggestions for vendors in the area are greatly welcomed&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903703,"PostDate":1440784271,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Fiance and I have started to plan our wedding for April 2017 and are highly considering Akiin Beach Tulum. Would love to hear from other brides who had their wedding at this Venue or from those who are planning to host their wedding at Akiin.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any other tips and suggestions for vendors in the area are greatly welcomed\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sugeily22@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.211.224.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440083284,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SuBe","Id":284502,"Name":"SuBe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ae61d8bf9b6c8c66b9df41a1f518dff","RawContent":"[quote name=\"SuBe\" post=\"1903703\" timestamp=\"1440802271\"]\nHi!\n\nMy Fiance and I have started to plan our wedding for April 2017 and are highly considering Akiin Beach Tulum. Would love to hear from other brides who had their wedding at this Venue or from those who are planning to host their wedding at Akiin. \n\nAny other tips and suggestions for vendors in the area are greatly welcomed  :)[\/quote]@[member=\"SuBe\"] everything is outdoors.  Akiin location offers you a more rustic feel and you do not have to do too much decor.   you have a wide stretch of beach.  food is great.  you bring your own vendors no extra fee.  also you can bring your own alcohol with a corkage fee.  I have a file with all catalog and pictures feel free to pm me your email . I can share it with you.\n\n\nHappy planning","Attachments":[],"Id":1903718,"PostDate":1440803312,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SuBe, on 28 August 2015 - 05:51 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Fiance and I have started to plan our wedding for April 2017 and are highly considering Akiin Beach Tulum. Would love to hear from other brides who had their wedding at this Venue or from those who are planning to host their wedding at Akiin.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any other tips and suggestions for vendors in the area are greatly welcomed\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284502\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284502-sube\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SuBe<\/span><\/a> everything is outdoors. \u00a0Akiin location offers you a more rustic feel and you do not have to do too much decor. \u00a0 you have a wide stretch of beach. \u00a0food is great. \u00a0you bring your own vendors no extra fee. \u00a0also you can bring your own alcohol with a corkage fee. \u00a0I have a file with all catalog and pictures feel free to pm me your email . I can share it with you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326836387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.80.72","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42902d3425f8eeab0b0ec9c86b000f6f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum SuBe and Congrats on your 2017 April wedding in Tulum!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It&#039;s certainly a gorgeous area - as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured at this venue: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153477913829487.1073741942.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Dreams Tulum Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11728769_10153477925994487_7191985534930908566_o.jpg\" alt=\"11728769_10153477925994487_7191985534930\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11754534_10153477928054487_4841978292342556757_o.jpg\" alt=\"11754534_10153477928054487_4841978292342\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11731974_10153477929714487_7535311141258715388_o.jpg\" alt=\"11731974_10153477929714487_7535311141258\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and all the best with your journey ahead - cheers!!! team mtm :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903728,"PostDate":1440847523,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum SuBe and Congrats on your 2017 April wedding in Tulum!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's certainly a gorgeous area - as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured at this venue: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153477913829487.1073741942.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Dreams Tulum Wedding Album<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11728769_10153477925994487_7191985534930908566_o.jpg\" alt=\"11728769_10153477925994487_7191985534930\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/11754534_10153477928054487_4841978292342556757_o.jpg\" alt=\"11754534_10153477928054487_4841978292342\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xft1\/t31.0-8\/11731974_10153477929714487_7535311141258715388_o.jpg\" alt=\"11731974_10153477929714487_7535311141258\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and all the best with your journey ahead - cheers!!! team mtm <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.160.133.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79545,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51240586dc6094b11079f59e2838cab5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congratulations on your upcoming event, Akiin Tulum is a great place, we have done several wedding receptions over there, and we have a package custom made for that location.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are glad you chose a nice a great location.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy your planning.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905625,"PostDate":1443547084,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations on your upcoming event, Akiin Tulum is a great place, we have done several wedding receptions over there, and we have a package custom made for that location.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are glad you chose a nice a great location.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Enjoy your planning.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><em><strong>Julian Molina<\/strong><\/em><\/p>\n<p><em><strong>Dj<\/strong><\/em><\/p>\n<p><b><i>Wedding Entertainment Consultant<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<p><b><i>www.julianmolina.me<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<p><b><i>Phone: +52 (998) 236 0134<\/i><\/b><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"julian.molina.info@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.185.71.164","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1274425546,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228415.jpg?_r=1443483879","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JwdEvents","Id":228415,"Name":"JwdEvents","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79545","Title":"New Bride April 2017 Akiin Tulum","LastPostDate":1443547084},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
